  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pigs That Ran Straightaway into the Water, Triumph Of**: back after 48 archived shows (1015 days); rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Running Away With What Freud Said**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **The House That Dripped Blood**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- **Half Dead**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Palmcorder Yajna**: back after 23 archived shows (506 days) [5]\n- **The Boys Are Back In Town**: back after 49 archived shows (1075 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2007-03-07** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 80 min; rated 3.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Some crackle and hiss is audible, but the reviewer says it was present at the show, not a recording flaw [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A few audience members behaved badly during the show, spoiling parts of it for the reviewer; the final five tracks are strong [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2007-03-07**: taped by Chris Bellew; transferred by Chris Bellew; source: SP-CMC-2>SP-SPSB-1>iRiver ihp-140 [1]",
